// Package client option categorization guide
//
// This document categorizes Kitex client options by their application scope:
// - Unary RPC options
// - Streaming RPC options  
// - TTHeader-Streaming specific options
//
// Most options apply to both unary and streaming RPCs unless noted otherwise.

package client

// UNARY RPC OPTIONS
// These options are primarily designed for unary (request-response) RPC patterns:
//
// Core unary options:
//   - WithShortConnection: Disables connection pooling, creates new connection per request
//   - WithRPCTimeout: Sets overall RPC timeout for unary calls
//   - WithConnectTimeout: Connection establishment timeout
//   - WithRetryPolicy: Retry configuration for failed unary calls
//   - WithFailureRetry: Enables basic retry on failure
//   - WithBackupRequest: Hedged requests for latency-sensitive unary RPCs
//   - WithFallback: Fallback handler when unary RPC fails
//
// STREAMING RPC OPTIONS
// These options apply specifically to streaming RPCs:
//
// Streaming-specific options:
//   - WithGRPCConnectTimeout: gRPC connection timeout for streaming
//   - WithGRPCKeepaliveParams: gRPC keepalive configuration for long-lived streams
//   - WithGRPCInitialWindowSize: Flow control window size for streams
//   - WithGRPCInitialConnWindowSize: Connection-level flow control
//   - WithGRPCMaxHeaderListSize: Header size limit for streaming metadata
//   - WithGRPCWriteBufferSize: Stream write buffer configuration
//   - WithGRPCReadBufferSize: Stream read buffer configuration
//
// Note: Retry and backup request options generally do NOT apply to streaming RPCs
// as streams maintain long-lived connections with bidirectional communication.
//
// TTHEADER-STREAMING OPTIONS
// TTHeader-Streaming (transport.TTHeaderStreaming = 64) combines TTHeader protocol
// with streaming semantics:
//
// TTHeader-Streaming options:
//   - WithTransportProtocol(transport.TTHeaderStreaming): Enable TTHeader streaming mode
//   - WithMetaHandler: TTHeader metadata processing for streaming
//   - WithPayloadCodec: Custom payload codec for TTHeader streams
//
// UNIVERSAL OPTIONS
// These options apply to both unary and streaming RPCs:
//
// Connection & Transport:
//   - WithHostPorts: Target server addresses
//   - WithResolver: Service discovery resolver
//   - WithLoadBalancer: Load balancing strategy
//   - WithConnPool: Custom connection pool
//   - WithDialer: Custom network dialer
//   - WithTransHandlerFactory: Custom transport handler
//
// Middleware & Observability:
//   - WithMiddleware: Request/response middleware
//   - WithMiddlewareBuilder: Context-aware middleware
//   - WithTracer: Distributed tracing
//   - WithStatsLevel: Stats collection level
//   - WithLogger: Custom logger
//
// Codec & Serialization:
//   - WithCodec: Custom codec (Thrift, Protobuf, etc.)
//   - WithPayloadCodec: Payload serialization
//   - WithCompressor: Compression algorithm
//
// Security & Metadata:
//   - WithMetaHandler: Request metadata handling
//   - WithBoundHandler: Connection bound/unbound callbacks
//
// Advanced:
//   - WithSuite: Option composition
//   - WithTag: Client identification tags
//   - WithWarmingUp: Connection warming
//   - WithCircuitBreaker: Circuit breaker configuration
//   - WithACLRules: Access control rules
//   - WithCloseCallbacks: Shutdown hooks
//   - WithContextBackup: Context preservation across retries
//   - WithErrorHandler: Global error handling
//
// MIGRATION GUIDE
// When migrating from unary to streaming:
// 1. Remove: WithRPCTimeout, WithRetryPolicy, WithFailureRetry, WithBackupRequest
// 2. Add: WithGRPCKeepaliveParams, WithGRPCInitialWindowSize (for gRPC streaming)
// 3. Keep: All universal options (middleware, tracing, load balancing, etc.)
//
// When using TTHeader-Streaming:
// 1. Set: WithTransportProtocol(transport.TTHeaderStreaming)
// 2. Configure: WithMetaHandler for TTHeader metadata
// 3. Optional: WithPayloadCodec for custom serialization

